<title>BRAZIL: Brazil CS sugar output to September 1 - AIAA.</title>
<headline>Brazil CS sugar output to September 1 - AIAA.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results to September 1 of the 1996/97 sugar harvest in Brazil's centre-south region were as follows, said the Association of Sugar and Alcohol Industries of Sao Paulo (AIAA).</p>
<p>				    1996/97	     1995/96</p>
<p>				  1/9	16/8	1/9	16/8</p>
<p>SUGAR CANE(mln tonnes)   144.80   124.17    120.06   100.41</p>
<p>SUGAR(mln tonnes)	    6.49     5.41	5.19     4.23</p>
<p>ALCOHOL(mln cubic meters)  7.54     6.42	6.23     5.19</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
